====================================================================
              		SPL QUERIES
====================================================================

1. Total Security Events Counter:
index=* sourcetype=WinEventLog:Security
| stats count

2. Successful Logins Count (Event Code 4624):
index=* sourcetype=WinEventLog:Security EventCode=4624 
| stats count

3. Failed Logins Count (Event Code 4625):
index=* sourcetype=WinEventLog:Security EventCode=4625
| stats count

4. Security Events Over Time (Hourly Trend):
index=* sourcetype=WinEventLog:Security
| timechart span=1h count

5. Top 10 Security Event IDs:
index=* sourcetype=WinEventLog:Security
| stats count by EventCode
| sort -count
| head 10

6. Top 10 Logged-in Accounts:
index=* sourcetype=WinEventLog:Security EventCode=4624
| top Account_Name limit=10

7. Top 10 Monitored Hosts:
index=* sourcetype=WinEventLog:Security
| top host limit=10

8. Logon Types Distribution:
index=* sourcetype=WinEventLog:Security EventCode=4624
| stats count by Logon_Type

9. Logon Activity Trend Over Time by User:
index=* EventCode=4624 
| timechart count by TargetUserName

====================================================================